[I] An extension to the GTK+ multiline text editing

[T] GtkSourceView is a portable C library that extends the standard GTK+
[T] framework for multiline text editing with support for configurable
[T] syntax highlighting, unlimited undo/redo, UTF-8 compliant caseless
[T] searching, printing and other features typical of a source code editor.

[U] https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gtksourceview

[A] Gustavo Giraldez <gustavo.giraldez@gmx.net>
[A] Paolo Maggi <paolo.maggi@polito.it>
